$$ = \sum_c (x^2)^c + 2 \sum_c x^c + n $$
$$ = \frac{x^{2(n+1)}}{x^2 - 1} - 1 + 2 \frac{x^{n+1} - x}{x-1} + n $$
$$ = \frac{x^{2n+2} - x^2}{x^2 - 1} + \frac{2(x^{n+1} - x)}{x-1} + n $$
